# CPU Scheduling

This folder contains the CPU Scheduling algorithms that I implemented during my Operating System Lab.

## Algorithms

- FCFS
- SJF
- Priority Scheduling
- Round Robin

## Language

C

## How to Run

```bash
gcc FCFS.c -o fcfs
./fcfs
```

## Output

The program calculates:

- Waiting Time
- Turnaround Time
- Average Waiting Time
- Average Turnaround Time
